{"id":"404231","name":"小葱泡菜","author":"朝族媳妇辣白菜","authorId":"10218894","desc":"","cover":"images/404231/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"400g"}],"sub":[{"name":"辣椒面","amount":"6大勺"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"1大勺"},{"name":"鱼露","amount":"5大勺"},{"name":"糖","amount":"2.5勺"},{"name":"糯米糊","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把糯米粉放入冷水中。","img":"images/404231/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/404231/step_2.gif"},{"step":3,"desc":"小火熬3分钟成糯米糊后放凉。","img":"images/404231/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"糯米糊放凉以后放入辣椒面。","img":"images/404231/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入白糖。","img":"images/404231/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入蒜末。","img":"images/404231/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鱼露。","img":"images/404231/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌均匀。","img":"images/404231/step_8.gif"},{"step":9,"desc":"在小葱上放入酱。","img":"images/404231/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把酱均匀涂沫在小葱上。","img":"images/404231/step_10.gif"},{"step":11,"desc":"把小葱卷起来。","img":"images/404231/step_11.gif"},{"step":12,"desc":"可以放入保鲜盒后，常温一天再放入冰箱。","img":"images/404231/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"爽口解腻的小葱泡菜就做好了！。","img":"images/404231/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"1.小葱要选择新鲜的嫩葱，入口有甜味的才好。\n2.鱼露是必不可少的调料，不能代替。\n3.泡菜是需要腌制的，一周左右味道更好！。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}